OL,3,GNEWSADafydd Owain wins #10,000 Welsh
OL,4,AMusic Prize 2026
OL,5,
OL,6,FSinger Dafydd Owain has won the 2026
OL,7,FWelsh Music Prize with his album
OL,8,FYmarfer Byw.
OL,10,FA total of 15 albums were shortlisted
OL,11,Ffor the #10,000 top prize across genres
OL,12,Ffrom rap and metal to pop, folk, rock
OL,13,Fand indie rock.
OL,15,FReceiving his award at Wales Millennium
OL,16,FCentre in Cardiff on Wednesday, Owain,
OL,17,Ffrom Caernarfon, said the last time he
OL,18,Fhad performed on the same stage was as
OL,19,Fa 16-year-old choir member.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
